# policy.matrix: what the gate of "wheelshop-agent" decides, for every action.
# Written by `pnpm policy:matrix` from agent.yaml's actions (their rules as written, and, for a change,
# `confirmed` over all its params last); a test fails when it differs. Never edit it by hand: a difference
# here is a change in what the agent may do, to be reviewed as the policy is.
#
# Every call is made by a caller nobody has proven (level 0): agent.yaml has no identity. Under each
# action (its level and its rules in the order they run), one line per kind of call, where a|b means
# either value.
# what a call carries
#   confirmed   none; match (the caller said yes to a read-back of exactly these values); mismatch
#   a param     for a param a oneOf or noneOf rule lists: the first value listed, and another value
# verdicts: ALLOW; BLOCK <reason>; STEP_UP to <level>; NEEDS_HUMAN <reason>

recognise_caller · level 0 · no rules
  every caller  ALLOW

check_availability · level 0 · no rules
  every caller  ALLOW

send_request · level 0 · confirmed(name, vehicle, wheels, damage, finish, slot, callbackNumber, textOk)
  every caller  confirmed none|mismatch  BLOCK confirmation
                confirmed match          ALLOW

send_photo_request · level 0 · oneOf(textOk: yes), confirmed(callbackNumber, textOk)
  every caller  textOk yes, confirmed none|mismatch  BLOCK confirmation
                textOk yes, confirmed match          ALLOW
                textOk another value                 BLOCK no-consent

notify_shop_request · level 0 · confirmed(name, vehicle, wheels, damage, finish, slot, callbackNumber, textOk)
  every caller  confirmed none|mismatch  BLOCK confirmation
                confirmed match          ALLOW

book_dealer · level 0 · confirmed(account, cars, vehicles, slot)
  every caller  confirmed none|mismatch  BLOCK confirmation
                confirmed match          ALLOW

notify_shop_booking · level 0 · confirmed(account, cars, vehicles, slot)
  every caller  confirmed none|mismatch  BLOCK confirmation
                confirmed match          ALLOW

leave_callback · level 0 · confirmed(name, callbackNumber, about)
  every caller  confirmed none|mismatch  BLOCK confirmation
                confirmed match          ALLOW

(unlisted) · an action agent.yaml does not list
  every caller  BLOCK unknown-tool
